{#- A short notice for an important update (i18n → notice: label + text, en and es), shown on the home page
    and on How to join, just above the Zoom details. There is none now: notice.text is empty, so nothing
    is rendered at all (the box carries its own spacing, noticeClass, so no empty wrapper is left behind).
    Post one by filling in both languages (docs/EDITING.md); the first build after the workshop has ended
    drops it (when.status, worked out at build time). -#}
{% if t.notice and t.notice.text and not when.status.isPast %}
<div class="notice{% if noticeClass %} {{ noticeClass }}{% endif %}" role="note">
  {% icon "info", "icon" %}
  <p>{% if t.notice.label %}<strong>{{ t.notice.label }}.</strong> {% endif %}{{ t.notice.text | tokens }}</p>
</div>
{% endif %}
